## Context

Observed 2026-10-12 during the 1053 re-pass check (scratch leg
`~/arena-scratch-1053/runs/0211-h/attempts/3` on padme): arm H
(openrouter `stealth/space-bunny-alpha`) answered HTTP 404 four times,
`stopReason: error`, empty assistant content, and `runner.py:427`
recorded `verdict: OK` in 0.8 s with cost 0. A provider error with no
output is scored as a successful leg; such legs then enter judging and
the tournament tables as OK. Cause in the verdict chain not yet isolated
(`provider_ok` / `empty_sub` inputs).

## Exit criteria

- [ ] A session whose every turn ends `stopReason: error` with no content
      is recorded as a VOID (or DNF), not OK; regression test or replay
      of the 0211-h transcript shows it
- [ ] Recorded OK legs in `~/arena/runs` audited for the same signature;
      count reported
